This file lists the contents of /xusr/man/man0:

   FILE		   DESCRIPTION
caa		Macros for printing PWN/UNIX User's Manual pages
contents	Table of Contents for PWN/UNIX User's Manual
documents	Documents for PWB/UNIX Time-Sharing System
index		Index for the PWN/UNIX User's Manual
introduction	Introduction to the PWB/UNIX User's Manual
ptx		Formatting codes to print the Index
toc		Formatting codes to print the Table of Contents
tocrc		Shell procedure to generate Table of Contents and Index

All these files can be printed via "cat" or "pr", except for
"introduction" (nroff introduction) and "documents" (nroff -mm documents).
